        "story": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>ProCavalli is not for the hobbyist. It is not for the weekend rider. It is for the competitor — the one who knows that on the day that counts, the smallest details make a big difference.</p><p>ProCavalli is the equestrian products arm of Horse Investment LLC. Founded in 1994, Horse Investments is Egypt's leading holding company dedicated to the advancement of equestrian sports in Egypt and the wider Middle East. Its mission is focused on three pillars: 1) importing, training, and selling European sport horses; 2) advising the institutions and investors building the future of the sport in the region, and 3) ProCavalli: the ultimate destination for the finest European equestrian products.</p><p>We do not source from a catalogue. We source from thirty-five years of practical experience. Top brands such as CWD, Stubben, Pikeur, KASK, Eskadron, Havens, TRM and others, have chosen ProCavalli to be their exclusive importer and distributor in Egypt.</p><p>Every product we source answers one question before it reaches you: Does it perform on the day that counts?</p>",
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 48,
            "inherit_text_alignment": false,
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "custom",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
