                "color": "var(--color-primary)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none"
              }
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Karim Hamdy</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "custom_width": 100,
                "inherit_text_alignment": false,
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                "font_size": "5.0rem",
                "font_weight": "400",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "padding-block-end": 32
              }
            },
            "story": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>ProCavalli could not have been assembled by anyone else. Across Europe and the Middle East, the breeders, trainers, and riders who know the sport call him one thing: El Proffo. The professor.</p><p>He has ridden for Egypt. He stood on the podium as a rider, as a trainer, and as a chef d'équipe. And there is one other podium on which he stands alone: no one has sourced more winning sport horses or more top-end equestrian products to Egypt than him.</p><p>For decades, his connections across Europe have kept him a step ahead of everyone else — in the horses he finds, and in the equipment he sources.</p><p>Where the market sees three aisles — apparel, tack, nutrition — Karim sees one integrated system. The right cut of a jacket. The fit of a boot. The balance of a saddle. The science of a nutrition program. On the day that matters, they conspire to produce the results.</p><p>Every investment the rider will make, from the horse itself down to the nail in its shoe, has passed through thirty-five years of Hamdy’s meticulous research.</p><p>This is the lifetime conviction upon which he built ProCavalli: at the top of the sport, talent is a given. It is the calculated investments and the small advantages that decide who wins.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "custom_width": 100,
                "inherit_text_alignment": false,
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "2.0rem",
                "font_weight": "400",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "kicker",
            "name",
            "story"
          ]
        },
