    "about_cofounder": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "copy": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
            "vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
            "gap": 6,
            "width": "custom",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "scheme_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "scheme_foreground_heading": "#19264D",
            "scheme_foreground": "#19264D",
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "custom_width": 48,
            "width_tablet": "fill",
            "width_mobile": "fill",
            "scheme_primary": "#C2A260"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "kicker": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Strategic Advisor</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "custom_width": 100,
                "inherit_text_alignment": false,
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                "font_size": "4.0rem",
                "font_weight": "600",
                "color": "var(--color-primary)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none"
              }
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Mahmoud Ramadan</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "custom_width": 100,
                "inherit_text_alignment": false,
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
                "font_size": "5.0rem",
                "font_weight": "400",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "padding-block-end": 32
              }
            },
            "story": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Mahmoud serves as Strategic Advisor to ProCavalli. A lifelong equestrian with deep roots in Egypt’s showjumping community, he understands that countless details shape the results in our sport, yet beneath them all lies a single, foundational truth: authentic riding is anchored on the connection between horse and rider, a connection built on trust and respect. This conviction shapes the vision he brings to ProCavalli: to connect riders and their horses with trustable and respectful world class equestrian products that enrich the riding experience and elevate performance in the show ring.</p><p>His counsel to ProCavalli is informed by a global perspective. For the past 16 years, he has held global leadership roles across online media, e-commerce, and impact investing at tech giants such as Yahoo, Google and Amazon across Dublin, London, and San Francisco. In the saddle, he has ridden and competed across the Middle East, Europe, and the United States. Having seen how the world's leading riders train and compete, he offers ProCavalli a view of international standards, helping bring that same caliber within reach of riders at home in Egypt.</p><p>Some stories actually come full circle! Thirty years ago, one week after he first sat on a horse, Mahmoud walked into Karim Hamdy’s office seeking counsel on how to start his riding career. A few clubs later, still searching for the standard he aspired for, Mahmoud found his way back to Karim, who eventually became his trainer. Today, as Karim launches ProCavalli, the e-commerce arm of Horse Investments, it's now Mahmoud’s turn to offer counsel – to bring together his equestrian and technology expertise to help ensure ProCavalli delivers a world-class experience, from the first click to the results in show ring.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "custom_width": 100,
                "inherit_text_alignment": false,
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "2.0rem",
                "font_weight": "400",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
                "unit": "percent",
                "width_tablet": "100%",
                "width_mobile": "100%",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "case": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "kicker",
            "name",
            "story"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pc-about-cofounder.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "adapt",
            "height": "fit",
            "image_position": "cover",
            "width": "custom",
            "unit": "percent",
            "custom_width": 48,
            "width_tablet": "custom",
            "unit_tablet": "percent",
            "custom_width_tablet": 100,
            "width_mobile": "custom",
            "unit_mobile": "percent",
            "custom_width_mobile": 100
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "copy",
        "image"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "content_direction": "row",
        "content_direction_mobile": "column",
        "wrap": "no-wrap",
        "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
        "vertical_alignment": "flex-start",
        "gap": 64,
        "section_width": "custom",
        "page_width_custom": 1620,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64
      },
      "custom_css": [
        ".text-block p + p {margin-block-start: 1.4em;}",
        "@media (max-width: 1024px) {.section-content-wrapper {flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;} .image-block {order: -1;}}"
      ]
    },
